# ── AlcheMix environment ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values. `.env` is git-ignored.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# ⚠️  NEVER prefix a secret with VITE_ — anything VITE_* is inlined into the
#     browser bundle and can be stolen. API keys stay SERVER-ONLY.
#     (See Free-Ai-Implementation-Tutorial.MD §2 — "the golden rule".)
#
# Firebase config is NOT configured here — it lives in src/lib/firebase.ts
# (public client values).

# Google Gemini API key — get a free one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# While this is left as the placeholder below (or unset), all AI features fall
# back to a keyless rule-based mode and submissions are routed to manual review.
GEMINI_API_KEY=__PLACEHOLDER_ADD_YOUR_GEMINI_KEY__

# Optional: override the default model (default: gemini-flash-latest).
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-flash-latest

# ── Brevo transactional email (sign-up verification codes) ───────────────────
# Server-only. Without a real key the sign-up code is logged to the server
# console instead of emailed (keyless dev fallback), so the flow still works.
#   • Verify the sender email first: https://app.brevo.com/senders/list
#   • Deactivate "Authorised IPs": https://app.brevo.com/security/authorised_ips
BREVO_API_KEY=__PLACEHOLDER_ADD_YOUR_BREVO_KEY__
BREVO_SENDER_EMAIL=no-reply@your-verified-domain.com
BREVO_SENDER_NAME=AlcheMix
# Optional: dedicated HMAC secret for signing verification tokens (else derived
# from BREVO_API_KEY). Any long random string.
# EMAIL_CODE_SECRET=

# ── Cloudinary hosting for scavenger evidence photos ─────────────────────────
# Create an UNSIGNED upload preset (Cloudinary → Settings → Upload → presets),
# then set both values. Until then, photos are stored inline in Firestore.
# (These two are public-by-design, so the VITE_ prefix is safe here.)
# VITE_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=your-cloud-name
# VITE_CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET=alchemix-evidence
# Signed-upload API secret (true secret, server-only) — optional, unused by the
# current unsigned flow.
# CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=__PLACEHOLDER_ADD_YOUR_CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET__
